C8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kFA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4d9cb64b-16b6-4414-bdf5-cb7f00ab6594","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"んー、 major バージョンが一個ずつずれてますけど","ts":"1617034771.287000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"STM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fe4dfcb4-3592-471d-a635-62098ebcb227","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"ちなみにsemverでは複数チャンネルを正確には表現できないなw","ts":"1617034756.286500","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1617034766.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"I04v"}]},{"client_msg_id":"98d01bc1-4325-4d1e-a9fc-8af869653f64","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"複数チャンネルは、semverとは関係ないんですよ。","ts":"1617034713.286100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nKoD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a06c519c-beed-4fbd-8f1c-daaab1e71d11","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"単一の安定ブランチだけ提供し続けるのはあんまり現実的じゃないかなって。それにしても semver じゃなくていいのはそうですが","ts":"1617034703.285800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MoD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e5dea5ac-7887-43fe-bb50-b2984e0ba964","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"Chrome みたいに channel が複数あるのを考えてました","ts":"1617034680.285100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"eAi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"631c11e4-ef27-40fe-8930-85a4283eb52f","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"あとはユーザーのわかりやすさ","ts":"1617034675.284800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3eskX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a4ad3c4b-9601-44bc-a43d-820d3f2f9ef8","type":"message","user":"UGJG6S9JM","text":"macOSの(システムがバージョンを認識するのに必要な)bundle versionだとシリアル値であればなんでもいいけれど、人間ようのなんでもいい文字列的なバージョンも他にある (Finderにはそっちが表示される)という意味でみためのバージョンはマーケティング的で、実際にはバージョンはシリアル値であればなんでもいいというそういう感じ。semverはなんでもいい文字列じゃない意味があるからちょとちがう。っていう感じ。","ts":"1617034665.284500","edited":{"user":"UGJG6S9JM","ts":"1617034803.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7hw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"895c40ec-bedc-4802-9feb-da7b59381d55","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"ローリングアップデートするはずだから単一の数字でよかろうって話?","ts":"1617034653.284100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Qw/x"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a40bbd49-6b8c-4bbe-85e7-581820807624","type":"message","user":"UGJG6S9JM","text":"semverのような見た目でもいいけど、semverのルールが必要ないと思ってる","ts":"1617034631.282800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"honsore","count":1,"users":["U06BRP8VD"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"V4Zug"}]},{"client_msg_id":"106be81c-0187-4ca3-bc37-386bbe17f70f","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"それがアプリにはそぐわないっていう主張です。","ts":"1617034624.282600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/pP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"774d5a16-0756-466f-a5ec-5fc87d37c2e4","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"semverってmajor, minor, patchの3レベルの関係が厳格じゃないですか。","ts":"1617034616.282100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Cp2l"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e6e39fa9-baaf-4614-a238-9e0bf5a3ec1b","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"semver である必要はないというのはそうですが、 semver がマッチしない、というのはわかりませんでした","ts":"1617034589.281500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RAc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"92fa24d3-eec6-4d78-9831-dc810c657471","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"それはsemverじゃなくて良いでしょ。","ts":"1617034558.280800","team":"T03C4RC8V","repl