デートするのはどうなのかって話?","ts":"1617034274.276000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"h+f"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1ad09c12-016b-4538-883e-080f153151cd","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"ということはなおさら semver で問題ないように思える","ts":"1617034244.275500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mUVa"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4b026b8d-de4a-4725-bf73-fe56f68c1806","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"ユーザー目線でいうとUIが刷新されると互換性は途切れちゃったように感じるんですよね。で、どのアプリ全体のどの部分でっていうのはユーザごとに微妙に違ってたり。","ts":"1617034191.274800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pJUv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ab531e7e-1709-4ae1-84bb-6bca486f7d4b","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"semver の major バージョンアップデートは移行措置が一切ないことを別に意味しないので…","ts":"1617034019.273500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Yrwk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c2dba2af-7ffe-46da-befa-8eb0491468a9","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"とはいえいつかはサポート切られる","ts":"1617033996.273000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RQlW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"630d28cc-8932-43fb-a5ae-3febb2599e77","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"そりゃ完全に互換性なくすんじゃなくて移行措置はありますよね","ts":"1617033988.272700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tVT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"732fc187-a9b9-45b0-82a8-85faf342b587","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"ユーザーデータの互換性なくなるようなアプリは大前提として失格な気がw","ts":"1617033966.272100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nKdv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a6f17d64-d790-4a28-99a4-128180f0a763","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"ユーザーデータの互換性があるかどうかでは semver マッチするんじゃないかと思うんですが。","ts":"1617033923.271600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uRwC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0024ab08-2179-4f65-8994-d856eb2cd067","type":"message","user":"UGJG6S9JM","text":"アプリのバージョンはマーケティング…","ts":"1617033877.271200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WsC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"608bea54-a8ef-4673-8cf8-b52713b5bbe4","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"ライブラリとアプリだとまた印象は全然違いますね。というかアプリにsemverはマッチしない。","ts":"1617033804.270500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6Pl5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ad7bf6f9-8ac4-4c18-a7e1-7c96210a5a5e","type":"message","user":"UGJG6S9JM","text":"semvarだと互換性維持が期待されるから、majorをあげざるをえないことが多い印象","ts":"1617033651.269800","edited":{"user":"UGJG6S9JM","ts":"1617033658.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"md2"}]}]
